      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَحْفَلَهُ</span></b> , (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَحْفَلَةٌ</span>, (TA,)
